[size=3][b]Bug Reports[/b][/size]

Found a glitch in the system? Use the [b]Bugs[/b] tab on this Nexus page or open an issue on [url=https://github.com/Y4rd13/david-sandevistan-plus/issues]GitHub[/url]. To help me track it down fast, include:

[list]
[*][b]Mod version[/b] (check the Files tab here).
[*][b]Game version[/b] (vanilla 2.2x, Phantom Liberty, etc.).
[*][b]Steps to reproduce[/b] - what exactly did you do, step by step.
[*][b]Expected behavior[/b] vs actual behavior.
[*][b]Screenshots or short video[/b] if the bug is visual.
[*][b]CET console output[/b] - enable Debug Logs in Mod Settings, reproduce the bug, then attach the relevant lines.
[*][b]Mod list[/b] - especially if another mod might be relevant (Dark Future, HUD overhauls, Sandevistan replacers, etc.).
[/list]

[b]Before reporting:[/b]
[list]
[*]Make sure all 8 required dependencies are installed and up to date.
[*]Check the Bugs tab and GitHub issues to see if someone already reported it.
[*]Try a clean save (load a save before installing the mod) to rule out persistent quest fact state.
[/list]

